    "section": "Annex A (informative) Database for classification stresses",
    "page": 51,
    "text": "\"Nil\" in the \"Treatment\" column in Table A.I means no preservative treatment. Some of the samples were tested in the green condition or in a condition of moisture content greater than the fibre saturation point. Other samples were seasoned and then butt soaked before they were tested for bending strength.",
