    "text": "The dimensions specified in Tables 4 to 13 are the minimum dimensions of the poles when offered to the purchaser, regardless of the state of seasoning. While it is recognized that some shrinkage will occur in seasoning, it is known that the dimensional loss is offset by an increase in fibre strength. Class H3 H2 HI",
