    "section": "Annex E (informative) SI (metric) versions of Tables 1 to 23",
    "page": 68,
    "text": "Tables E.I to E. 23 provide Sl (metric) equivalents for Tables 1 to 23. The dimensions specified in Tables 4 to 23 have been converted to Sl units in Tables E.4 to E.23 by recalculating the theoretical circumference at 1.83 m (6 ft) from the butt in yard/pound units. The results have then been converted to centimetres and rounded to the nearest centimetre. This is thought to be more accurate than converting the values in Tables 4 to 23, which are rounded to the nearest 13 mm (1/2 in). In cases of dispute, the dimensions specified in Tables I to 23 should govern.",
